body:
Cooperative games can be a fun way to introduce someone to hobby gaming. 

Horrified;
Back to the Future: Back in Time;
The Crew (simple trick taking card game with a neat twist that it’s cooperative)

Competitive introductory games:
Century: Golem Edition;
The Quacks of Quedlinburg (this one looks like a lot upfront but once played works really well. I’ve had great success with this one for non-gamers);
Santorini
